SUMMARY 
 Responsible for providing customer service and overall service of assigned customers and/or policies, soliciting of new business on existing accounts and support of Producer-led new business efforts. Provides mentoring to staff to support immediate supervisor.
 ESSENTIAL DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES 
 Identifies new leads and gathers the necessary information for submissions;
 Develops, presents and sells new business proposals to appropriate prospects;
 Gathers necessary information; develops, delivers and sells renewal proposals;
 Performs periodic service calls on all accounts and provides or coordinates customer service as requested;
 Sells additional coverage to existing customers;
 Facilitates joint sales calls and the sharing of lead information among departmental members;
 Attends and actively participates in regular sales meetings;
 Participates in the overall agency effort to develop and maintain strong company relationships through positive professional contacts with company representatives;
 Achieves annual sales goals and provides regular feedback to the Managing Director on progress toward those goals;
 Achieves educational and professional development goals established by agency management;
 Maintains a professional demeanor and actively supports and promotes a positive public image for the agency;
 Other duties as assigned.
 QUALIFICATIONS 
 EDUCATION / EXPERIENCE 
 One or more year of insurance industry experience; PEO experience preferred
 Valid insurance license
 Must continue to meet Continuing Education requirements 
